# The rEFInd 0.14.2 source tarball this project patches, by content.
#
# build-refind.sh downloads it from SourceForge over TLS and then compiles the
# result into the program that starts the machine. TLS says the bytes arrived
# from the host they were asked for; it does not say the host is serving what it
# served the day this patch was written. This does.
#
